  "remarks": "OOO Sea Engineering Limited is a shipping company based in St. Petersburg that specialises in providing technical support. The company is the technical manager of the vessels Nimbus SPB, G. Rossini and G. Puccini. Those vessels lack adequate liability insurance and have engaged in ship-to-ship transfers as well as manipulation of Automatic Identification Systems while transporting crude oil or petroleum products exported from Russia. Therefore, OOO Sea Engineering Limited manages vessels that transport crude oil or petroleum products exported from Russia and practice irregular and high-risk shipping practices as set out in the International Maritime Organization General Assembly resolution A.1192(33).",
